WEBVTT

00:08:25.595 --> 00:08:31.848
say that they have been sexually assaulted some time in their life.

00:08:31.848 --> 00:08:35.632
Now, I don't think that's the fault of popular entertainment.

00:08:35.632 --> 00:08:39.915
I don't think kids' movies have anything to do with that.

00:08:39.915 --> 00:08:41.693
I don't even think that

00:08:41.693 --> 00:08:45.248
music videos or pornography are really directly related to that,

00:08:45.248 --> 00:08:48.013
but something is going wrong,

00:08:48.013 --> 00:08:51.064
and when I hear that statistic,

00:08:51.064 --> 00:08:53.569
one of the things I think of is

00:08:53.569 --> 00:08:57.694
that's a lot of sexual assailants.

00:08:57.694 --> 00:09:01.054
Who are these guys? What are they learning?